[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5519688827","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123125#issuecomment-5519688827","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123125","id":5519688827,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSP_Eew","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T03:02:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T03:02:44Z","body":"The biggest perfomance hit seems to come from the gizmos drawing, as disabling them makes the `D3D12` more close from `Vulkan` perfomance.\n\n**Vulkan with visible gizmos:**\n\n<img width=\"837\" height=\"431\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1be614fd-9e63-4d25-ad27-f156481ff003\" />\n\n**D3D12 with visible gizmos:**\n\n<img width=\"820\" height=\"452\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f99860e7-927d-464a-ae91-a9d3cc50c70b\" />\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n**Vulkan without gizmos:**\n\n<img width=\"829\" height=\"439\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcce3df0-f8b9-4d02-94b2-3d5b98911afb\" />\n\n**D3D12 without gizmos:**\n\n<img width=\"805\" height=\"433\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33ebc18e-54fd-425d-8b83-e460caef72b5\" />\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n> Godot v4.8.dev4 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors (1920x1080 @ 60.00 Hz, 1920x1080 @ 120.00 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated Intel(R) Arc(TM) B580 Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.8974) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5519688827/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5520788005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123125#issuecomment-5520788005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123125","id":5520788005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSRCKJQ","user":{"login":"20k","id":755197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NTE5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/755197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k","html_url":"https://github.com/20k","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20k/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T05:08:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T05:08:04Z","body":"I've noticed about a 20-30% performance delta in a game I'm building between d3d12 and vulkan as well, on windows across a variety of hardware. It was much larger than I expected, for a game running at ~40fps, swapping to vulkan gave 10-20fps (on a 1660 super) which was a major surprise","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5520788005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5523132779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123125#issuecomment-5523132779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123125","id":5523132779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSTRRaw","user":{"login":"F3der1co","id":89512047,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTEyMDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89512047?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co","html_url":"https://github.com/F3der1co","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T08:50:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T08:51:24Z","body":"I